  "dataset_kind": "current_nameplate_historical_variant_color_tables",
  "scope": "Direct visual transcription of the complete exterior solid-paint charts printed in the retained official 2005 and 2007 Chevrolet Equinox vehicle information kits, plus a qualified 2006 Equinox palette reconstructed without adjacent-year inference from an exact Equinox list and code crosswalk in the 2006 General Motors Color Compatibility Guide, a complete General Motors of Canada Equinox brochure, and an exact United States secondary model-year listing. The 2006 palette remains qualified because no governing United States order guide or vehicle information kit was retained.",
  "method": {
    "review_type": "complete_document_visual_review_plus_secondary_triangulation",
    "render_scale": "Every page of the 100-page 2005 kit and 114-page 2007 kit was reviewed in contact sheets rendered at 72 dpi. The governing paint tables were rendered at 300 dpi. Every page of the 24-page 2006 General Motors of Canada brochure and 40-page 2006 General Motors Color Compatibility Guide was also reviewed in contact sheets, and every Equinox code row and brochure color page was rendered at 300 dpi.",
    "source_integrity": "Each retained official GM Heritage PDF matched the SHA-256, byte count, and page count in the 691-source artifact ledger. Both retained 2006 corroborating PDFs were downloaded in full, hashed, opened, and visually reviewed.",
    "code_policy": "For 2005 and 2007, source_color_code and wa_number preserve the Color Code and Touch Up Paint Number printed in the governing Chevrolet chart. For 2006, Chevrolet marketing names and two-digit codes come from the complete General Motors of Canada brochure and the exact United States CarsDirect list, while U-suffix codes and WA numbers come from the Equinox rows in the 2006 General Motors Color Compatibility Guide. No adjacent-year code is projected.",
    "absence_policy": "A program marked not located documents only that no separate chart for that program was found in the complete reviewed sources. It does not prove that the program was unavailable through every ordering or fleet channel.",
    "gap_policy": "The official GM Heritage Chevrolet kit index and the retained 691-source artifact corpus contain no 2006 Chevrolet Equinox vehicle information kit. The 2005 and 2007 kits were not used to infer the 2006 palette. The exact 2006 cross-source result remains qualified because the retained manufacturer brochure is Canadian and the retained United States source is secondary.",
    "market_policy": "Canadian trim compatibility is recorded only as corroborating evidence and is not asserted as a United States restriction. The United States palette claim is limited to the nine exterior color names independently listed by CarsDirect and matched to exact Equinox code rows in the compatibility guide.",
    "archive_manifest_review": "The retained public Release manifests were searched by SHA-256. The 2005 and 2007 GM Heritage PDFs were not yet listed when this audit was created, so each retains a null archive URL and an explicit not-listed status. The two 2006 corroborating PDFs are retained complete under tmp for source review and are not represented as public Release assets in this audit."
  },
